      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When the magmin dies, it collapses into a Tiny cinder cone. On initiative count 20 after the magmin dies, the cinder cone erupts in a burst of fire and lava. Each creature within 10 feet of the cone must make a DC 11 DEX save, taking 7 (2d6) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried in that area are ignited."
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
